      ],
      "source": "https://www.haytihistoricalsociety.org/"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Passtown Elementary School’s historic building is listed on the National Register of Historic Places for its role in Hayti’s African‑American educational heritage.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        3
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.haytihistoricalsociety.org/"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Hayti Cemetery, also called New Evergreen, honors those who fought for freedom and is a key memorial site in the area.",
